.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Documentation
docs/
*.md
specs/

# Config
.husky/
.serena/
.claude/
.specify/

# Misc
.backups/
